  m_Text: 'CONTROLS (CUSTOMIZABLE IN CONTROLS MENU)

    A/D : Move   |   L-Shift
    : Sprint   |   Space : Jump / Air Glide   |   RMB : Dash

    L-Ctrl : Harpoon  
    |   L-Alt : Silksoar   |   1 : Switch Crest (Hunter/Reaper/Witch)

    LMB :
    Attack / Hold Charge (+W/S)   |   Q : Silk Skills   |   C : Pale Nails

    R
    : Cross Stitch   |   H : Bind Heal   |   N : Needolin'
